      "blocks": {
        "item_6NaVYP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earr-6.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Hoops",
            "description": "<p>Hoop earrings are staples in any jewelry collection, and for good reason. They can instantly elevate any outfit, and their minimalistic design allows for a variety of styles, such as dainty, chunky, diamond-encrusted, or double hoops, to name a few.</p><p>Not to mention, they look great either worn on their own or as part of a stylish stack. Needless to say, having a few different styles of hoop earrings in your collection is always a great idea.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_4GdjVN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earr-5.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Drop earrings",
            "description": "<p>From short and minimalist drop earrings to long statement designs, these pieces are super eye-catching. Their elongated silhouette draws attention to your face, making sure all eyes are on you.</p><p>For an even prettier effect, opt for diamond drop earrings. These gorgeous designs beautifully reflect the light, bringing extra sparkle to your eyes. Diamond drop earrings are all you need to look effortlessly glamorous on any occasion.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_f3BcGq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earr-4.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Diamond studs",
            "description": "<p>When it comes to timeless earrings, diamond studs take the cake. These stunning earrings are incredibly beautiful and versatile, making them the perfect fit for any occasion.</p><p>Their glamorous-yet-minimalistic design is all you need to top off everything from casual outfits to full-glam looks. Be it at the office or at a fancy dinner party, diamond studs instantly add a touch of sophistication to any outfit - they’re the epitome of effortless elegance, after all.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_MByMT9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earr-3.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Diamond earrings",
            "description": "<p>No matter which earring design you prefer, one thing’s for sure: diamonds make everything better. Do you love hoops? Then opt for diamond hoops instead of plain ones. Are you more of a drop earring kind of girl? No problem! Diamond drops are just what you need.</p><p>Diamond earrings are perfect for every occasion, and they always make a statement. From the most show-stopping designs to the most minimalist ones, diamond earrings have the power to transform entire looks. Not only are they pieces which pack a punch, but also accessories that you’ll treasure for a lifetime.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_n87LnF": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earr-2.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Gold earrings",
            "description": "<p>Whether you prefer white, yellow, or rose gold, having a few pairs of gold earrings in your jewelry box is a must. After all, they’re incredibly elegant, super versatile, and never go out of style.</p><p>Between yellow gold hoops, white gold dangles, rose gold studs, and even two-tone gold designs, your options are endless. For an ultra-stylish look, mix and match gold earrings of different colors to create a unique stack.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_wHT8MN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/earr-1.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Pearls",
            "description": "<p>There's much more to pearl earrings than the classic studs you’ve probably just pictured. Sure, the classic pearl stud is a great staple to have in your jewelry box, but you can put a spin on the classic by opting for more unique designs.</p><p>Some stunning options include pearl drops, colorful pearl earrings, pearl huggies, and pearl studs with diamond accents. No matter which design you prefer, there’s no denying that a nice pair of pearl earrings is a great piece to have in your jewelry collection.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        }
      },
